  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">제가 드디어 중2를 떠나게 되어서... 그동안 매년 보완해왔던 학습지와 수행평가 계획을 공개합니다...<br>매년 수정했지만 많이 부족합니다 ㅠㅠ 오류를 발견하시면 댓글로 알려주세요~<br>&#160;<br>교과서 쪽수는 비상 기준입니다. 이미지는 비상 게 아닌 것도 많습니다... ^^...<br>&#160;<br>제가 단원 순서 재구성을 해서 쪽수는 아래와 같이 되어 있습니다. 수정해서 사용하셔요!<br>&#160;<br>1학기</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 71.3226%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 36.4851%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원명</span></td><td style=\"width: 37.3903%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">학습지</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 36.4851%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">물질의 구성</span></span></td><td style=\"width: 37.3903%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1~18</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">쪽</span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 36.4851%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">6</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">물질의 특성</span></span></td><td style=\"width: 37.3903%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">19~38</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">쪽</span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 36.4851%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">태양계</span></span></td><td style=\"width: 37.3903%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">39~54</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">쪽</span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 36.4851%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">8</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">열과 우리 생활</span></span></td><td style=\"width: 37.3903%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">55~64</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">쪽</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>2학기</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 71.4462%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 48.4429%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원명</span></td><td style=\"width: 51.3841%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">학습지</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 48.4429%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">전기와 자기</span></span></td><td style=\"width: 51.3841%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1~24</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">쪽</span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 10px;\"><td style=\"width: 48.4429%; height: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">단원</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">동물과 에너지</span></span